('APX-S-1806-1', 'APX-C-1806', 1, null, null, null, 'A vast frozen valley under pale twilight. Towering glacier walls reflect soft blue light across the snowfield while wind sweeps fine snow particles across the surface. The frozen ground glitters with crystalline frost. **Action:** 15.0s sequence from the first-person perspective of a massive glacier tiger stalking prey.', null, null, 'A vast frozen valley under pale twilight. Towering glacier walls reflect soft blue light across the snowfield while wind sweeps fine snow particles across the surface. The frozen ground glitters with crystalline frost.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
