('APX-S-1775-1', 'APX-C-1775', 1, null, null, null, 'Seamless infinity zoom hyperlapse through highly detailed paper-cut art capturing the journey of Ramadan to Eid celebration. The scene begins with a glowing crescent moon above a quiet neighborhood at sahur time, soft lantern lights flickering. The camera zooms into a house window where a family is preparing sahur, then transitions smoothly into a fast-paced hyperlapse of daily fasting moments—people working, praying, and waiting for iftar. The zoom continues into a bustling street filled with takjil vendors and crowds at sunset, then transitions into chaotic Eid homecoming traffic (mudik), with packed cars and motorbikes moving in dynamic hyperlapse motion.', null, null, 'The camera into a house window where a family is preparing sahur, then transitions smoothly into a fast-paced hyperlapse of daily fasting moments—people working, praying, and waiting for iftar.', 'family', null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-1775-2', 'APX-C-1775', 2, null, null, null, 'The camera zooms into one vehicle window, transitioning into a peaceful village scene (kampung) with children playing and people preparing for Eid. The zoom continues into a mosque where people are performing Eid prayer (sholat Ied) in a wide open field at sunrise. Seamlessly, the camera zooms into a handshake moment, transitioning into emotional family reunions with ‘maaf-maafan’. The zoom continues into a dining table filled with ketupat, opor ayam, and traditional dishes, where a big family gathers and eats together joyfully.', null, null, 'The camera into one vehicle window, transitioning into a peaceful village scene (kampung) with children playing and people preparing for Eid.', 'family', 'feasting', null, null, 'village', 'calm'),
('APX-S-1775-3', 'APX-C-1775', 3, null, null, null, null, 1207, 515, 'Finally, the camera into a ketupat, transitioning back into the crescent moon in the sky, completing the loop.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
